# Smart Sea Belt – Test Results

This folder contains the testing and validation records of the Smart Sea Belt prototype.

## Testing Conducted

The prototype was tested in a backwater environment to evaluate its functional operation and integrated system performance.

## Test Documentation

- Backwater Test Report
- Test photographs
- Prototype testing evidence
- Functional observations

## Test Environment

The prototype was tested in a controlled backwater environment as part of the initial prototype validation.

## Purpose of Testing

The testing was conducted to observe the practical operation of the prototype's major safety, monitoring and communication functions.

## Validation Status

The backwater test provides prototype-level functional validation.

Further testing is required under different environmental and operational conditions before deployment in open-water marine environments.

## Supporting Evidence

Test photographs and related evidence are maintained in this folder.
